---
description: BAMN-compatible baseline for E2E generator
alwaysApply: true
---

Project: E2E Event Generator for BAMN POC.

Strict baseline:
- Java 11
- JVM target 11
- Kotlin 1.4.32
- Spring Boot 2.4.5
- Spring Framework 5.3.6
- Spring Kafka 2.7.0
- Kafka Clients 3.0.0
- Jackson 2.12.3
- CloudEvents 2.0.0
- Gradle 6.8

Do not upgrade versions automatically.
Do not migrate to Spring Boot 3.
Do not use Java 17/21.
Do not use APIs introduced after the pinned baseline.

Build outputs:
1. executable Spring Boot fat JAR;
2. Docker image running exactly the same JAR on Java 11.

Generator is standalone POC utility.
No PostgreSQL.
No ABYSS dependency.
No BAMN source dependency.
